proTips.notes:
- RIFTBEAST stage 2, 3, 4: Buff on your carry (Cinderling / Pebbles);
- RIFTBEAST stage 5+: Buff on Scuttlecrab or Elder Dragon (if you need more DMG / execute);
- itemise CINDERLING > PEBBLES;
- stage 2-5 or 3-1 lvl 5 roll for Pebbles and Cinderling -> need them at least 2star & roll for 5 Riftbeast
- keep rolling stage 3 for 3star Pebbles/Cinderling;
- push lvl 7 in stage 3-5 or 4-1 and roll for 7 Riftbeasts -> big powerspike, should be able to win whole of stage 3;

- BLACKTHORN: Sacrifice highest cost caster (Zyra2 > Teemo2 > Veigar2 > Zyra1) -> AP & Manareg for Azir;
- SPRYKIN: Rammus;
- if no RAMMUS3 -> Fiddlesticks3 can be your main tank;
- AZIR 3rd item can be either Rageblade (good early, not the best late game), Rabadons (best late game but need a lot of rods);

- best to play from KHA'ZIX opener in 2-1;
- KHA'ZIX evolutions in this order: Ravager > Executioner > Spellweaver > Rapidfire;
- Yunara & Azir if you didn't find Ezreal & Soraka yet;
- if no HECARIM3 -> try to 3star Fiddlesticks as main tank;

- BLACKTHORN: sacrifice Lifebloom early because it's not worth to sacrifice your units early yet;
- ORNN farms artifact: Best ones for Veigar in this order -> Dawncore > Eternal Pact > Luden's > Talisman;
- CONSUMING FLORA augment is OP -> instead of Gunblade on Veigar;
